    liisoya/xiaomipad-8pro-mainline 8bbc68239c17 (MIT), and src/panel.cpp (sha256
    1e869d48874237a3529f04dce8fa4610f56ad83b9e3761a7d788402d9de59cb6), MIT: the orientation (X never flipped; BOE as processor Y,
